      "id": "stat11-s145-q30",
      "en": "The second moment about the mean of a symmetrical distribution is 3.5. What must be the value of the fourth moment about the mean in order that the distribution be (i) lepto-kurtic (ii) mesto-kurtic (iii) platy- kurtic.",
